
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.ReplaceSubString(InitialString: string, SubString: string, NewSubString: string, Count: number): string`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`string llReplaceSubString(string InitialString, string SubString, string NewSubString, integer Count);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a string that is the result of replacing the first <b>count</b> matching instances <b>pattern</b> in <b>src</b> with <b>replacement_pattern</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>InitialString / src</td>
          <td>The original string in which to hunt for substring matches.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>SubString / pattern</td>
          <td>The original substring to find.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>NewSubString / replacement_pattern</td>
          <td>The new substring used to replace.</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>number</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>integer</span></td>
          <td>Count / count</td>
          <td>The max number of replacements to make. Zero Count means "replace all". Positive Count moves left to right. Negative moves right to left.</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>string</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">Energy</span><span class="tech-val">10</span></div>
      <div class="tech-item"><span class="tech-label">LSO ID</span><span class="tech-val">541</span></div>

      <div class="label-stack">
        <span class="attr-label bg-pure">Side-Effect Free</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <p>If <b>count</b> = 0, all matching substrings are replaced. If <b>count</b> &gt; 0, substrings are replaced starting from the left/beginning of <b>src</b>. If <b>count</b> &lt; 0, substrings are replaced starting from the right/end of <b>src</b>.</p>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local function main()
    local ex = "red foxes, red hens, red turnips"
    -- Replace first 2 matches, starting from the left side
    ex = ll.ReplaceSubString(ex, "red", "blue", 2)
    ll.Say(0, ex)  -- Should say "blue foxes, blue hens, red turnips"
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default
{
    state_entry()
    {
        string ex = "red foxes, red hens, red turnips";
        // Replace first 2 matches, starting from the left side
        ex = llReplaceSubString(ex, "red", "blue", 2);
        llSay(0, ex); // Should say "blue foxes, blue hens, red turnips"
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local function main()
    local ex = "red foxes, red hens, red turnips"
    -- Replace first match, starting from the right side
    ex = ll.ReplaceSubString(ex, "red", "green", -1)
    ll.Say(0, ex)  -- Should say "red foxes, red hens, green turnips"
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default
{
    state_entry()
    {
        string ex = "red foxes, red hens, red turnips";
        // Replace first match, starting from the right side
        ex = llReplaceSubString(ex, "red", "green", -1);
        llSay(0, ex); // Should say "red foxes, red hens, green turnips"
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`local function main()
    local ex = "red foxes, red hens, red turnips"
    -- Replace all matches
    ex = ll.ReplaceSubString(ex, "red", "yellow", 0)
    ll.Say(0, ex)  -- Should say "yellow foxes, yellow hens, yellow turnips"
end

main()
`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`default
{
    state_entry()
    {
        string ex = "red foxes, red hens, red turnips";
        // Replace all matches
        ex = llReplaceSubString(ex, "red", "yellow", 0);
        llSay(0, ex); // Should say "yellow foxes, yellow hens, yellow turnips"
    }
}`} lang="lsl" /></div>
